      <title>新华保险半年净利227亿超过去两年总和，市场仍4折给内含价值定价</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260905/%E6%96%B0%E5%8D%8E%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9%E5%8D%8A%E5%B9%B4%E5%87%80%E5%88%A9227%E4%BA%BF%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%87%E5%8E%BB%E4%B8%A4%E5%B9%B4%E6%80%BB%E5%92%8C%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA%E4%BB%8D4%E6%8A%98%E7%BB%99%E5%86%85%E5%90%AB%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC%E5%AE%9A%E4%BB%B7/</link>
